{"3977630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Liturge", "steam_appid": 3977630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977630/extras/009a78bc6c199150b821e48adafe7c0a.avif?t=1774460450\" width=1280 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liturge is a cooperative investigative horror game for 1-4 players. A team of LRI Operators investigates haunted locations, gathers paranormal evidence, and identifies the entity responsible for the activity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Investigate the Paranormal</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather paranormal evidence - Use specialized tools to detect phenomena and collect the evidence needed to identify the entity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze unexplained phenomena - Observe paranormal activity and confirm additional evidence to narrow down possible entity types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Identify the entity - Combine the collected evidence to determine which entity is responsible for the haunting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977630/extras/647b097214c0d44772d9dd0b4421ca8d.poster.avif?t=1774460450\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977630/extras/647b097214c0d44772d9dd0b4421ca8d.webm?t=1774460450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977630/extras/647b097214c0d44772d9dd0b4421ca8d.mp4?t=1774460450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Face Different Entities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different entity types - Each entity has its own traits and patterns that influence the course of the investigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique behaviors and abilities - Entities react differently to player actions and can escalate paranormal activity in different ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977630/extras/332f8664b3a04ae0d6ade1ae27bb1bca.poster.avif?t=1774460450\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977630/extras/332f8664b3a04ae0d6ade1ae27bb1bca.webm?t=1774460450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977630/extras/332f8664b3a04ae0d6ade1ae27bb1bca.mp4?t=1774460450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Survive the Investigation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >manage power and lighting systems - The generator and building lighting affect the situation inside the location. Keeping the power on requires fuel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >work together as a team - Cooperation allows players to gather evidence faster and respond to changing situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >multiple difficulty levels - Different difficulty levels change the pace of the investigation and the overall level of threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977630/extras/d065f197a04d194e1f4a9d0d35af75e2.poster.avif?t=1774460450\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977630/extras/d065f197a04d194e1f4a9d0d35af75e2.webm?t=1774460450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977630/extras/d065f197a04d194e1f4a9d0d35af75e2.mp4?t=1774460450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Join the Liturgical Research &amp; Intervention Operation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Liturgical Research &amp; Intervention operator, you enter haunted locations to document paranormal activity, secure evidence, and identify the entity responsible for the threat. Use specialized equipment, work as a team, and maintain control as the investigation begins to turn into a fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977630/extras/009a78bc6c199150b821e48adafe7c0a.avif?t=1774460450\" width=1280 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liturge is a cooperative investigative horror game for 1-4 players. A team of LRI Operators investigates haunted locations, gathers paranormal evidence, and identifies the entity responsible for the activity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Investigate the Paranormal</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather paranormal evidence - Use specialized tools to detect phenomena and collect the evidence needed to identify the entity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze unexplained phenomena - Observe paranormal activity and confirm additional evidence to narrow down possible entity types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Identify the entity - Combine the collected evidence to determine which entity is responsible for the haunting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977630/extras/647b097214c0d44772d9dd0b4421ca8d.poster.avif?t=1774460450\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977630/extras/647b097214c0d44772d9dd0b4421ca8d.webm?t=1774460450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977630/extras/647b097214c0d44772d9dd0b4421ca8d.mp4?t=1774460450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Face Different Entities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different entity types - Each entity has its own traits and patterns that influence the course of the investigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique behaviors and abilities - Entities react differently to player actions and can escalate paranormal activity in different ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977630/extras/332f8664b3a04ae0d6ade1ae27bb1bca.poster.avif?t=1774460450\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977630/extras/332f8664b3a04ae0d6ade1ae27bb1bca.webm?t=1774460450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977630/extras/332f8664b3a04ae0d6ade1ae27bb1bca.mp4?t=1774460450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Survive the Investigation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >manage power and lighting systems - The generator and building lighting affect the situation inside the location. Keeping the power on requires fuel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >work together as a team - Cooperation allows players to gather evidence faster and respond to changing situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >multiple difficulty levels - Different difficulty levels change the pace of the investigation and the overall level of threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977630/extras/d065f197a04d194e1f4a9d0d35af75e2.poster.avif?t=1774460450\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977630/extras/d065f197a04d194e1f4a9d0d35af75e2.webm?t=1774460450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977630/extras/d065f197a04d194e1f4a9d0d35af75e2.mp4?t=1774460450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Join the Liturgical Research &amp; Intervention Operation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Liturgical Research &amp; Intervention operator, you enter haunted locations to document paranormal activity, secure evidence, and identify the entity responsible for the threat. Use specialized equipment, work as a team, and maintain control as the investigation begins to turn into a fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Liturge is a cooperative investigative horror game for 1-4 players. A team of LRI Operators investigates haunted locations, gathers paranormal evidence, and identifies the entity responsible for the activity.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977630/1d00c49c192a88ea111590f22f27221551b8bce5/header.jpg?t=1774460450", "capsule_image": "https://shared.ak